{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">邢慧敏近日迎來放鬆時光，特意前往澳門展開一趟快閃之旅「Chill 一 Chill」！她在此行除了盡情品嘗美食、大飽口福之外，更趁機來個「下水禮」，事後在社交網大方分享水着靚相，向粉絲派發驚喜福利。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6d65533e-0583-4044-ad77-f68333abdb62.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/202687AZXK37HF1790304013.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6d65533e-0583-4044-ad77-f68333abdb62.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">從分享的相片中可見，身處澳門度假酒店露天泳池邊的邢慧敏，身穿一套一件頭吊帶掛頸泳衣，悠閒地躺在池畔的太陽椅上享受日光浴。她大方展露其招牌的逆天修長美腿，完美演繹出健康美。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"05e25584-80d6-45d5-9cb8-7b69d54b54e5.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026geqJkRpcJn1790304012.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"05e25584-80d6-45d5-9cb8-7b69d54b54e5.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">難得可以出走充電，邢慧敏亦開心發文寫道：「快閃澳門之旅🇲🇴曬一曬太陽～吸收一下維他命D🌞」，字裡行間完全流露出她滿滿的愜意與放假的好心情！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"dc688257-2ad6-4adf-8415-dfdd874624f2.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20269s660aoMyw1790304012.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"dc688257-2ad6-4adf-8415-dfdd874624f2.jpg.webp\"/></div></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-27T02:58:11.372906+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":254,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}